            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "krbrown2000"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a good, basic sauce for when you're making pizza and realize you don't have any pizza sauce in a jar (and I didn't have tomato paste or crushed tomatoes like a lot of other recipes required). I added a pinch of salt, and I also used a teaspoon of Italian seasonings instead of basil and oregano, and I used garlic powder instead of minced garlic. I know I changed up a lot, but I do appreciate that this recipe gave me the basic measurements.",
            "datePublished": "2023-08-18T21:27:34.671Z"
          }
